            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.15</h2>
<p>Polish for calendar events and UI text selection.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Chrome UI (logo, headings, buttons) is no longer selectable; notes, Enhanced, transcripts, and Ask Anything replies still are.</li>
  <li>Calendar event titles and times sit at the top of the event card.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
