            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.14</h2>
<p>Keeps the calendar column focused on day view.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Removes the Day / Week / Month toggle from the single-column calendar.</li>
  <li>Day / Week / Month remain available in the full calendar view.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
